    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Security-adjacent read surface whose likeliest failure is SILENT and fail-open: a masked sprk_issecure or a faulted deny-list read rendered as "no banner" tells every viewer a secure or walled record is unrestricted. The tri-state (applies / does not apply / unknown) must survive four layers (Dataverse read, composer, DTO, two clients).</model-tier-reason>
